{"step_index":3550,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T18:50:16Z","thinking":"Initiating a network request to the conversational endpoint, preparing to send a payload with specific headers and cookies. The request will simulate a user session and handle the response stream. Considering the request timeout setting.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Test batch sizes against MSEMAX to find 413 threshold","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"import requests\nimport json\nimport time\n\nurl = \"http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/chat/completions\"\napi_key = \"[REDACTED_CREDENTIAL]\"\n\ndef test_items(count):\n    cases = []\n    for i in range(count):\n        cases.append({\n            \"case_id\": f\"Q{i+1:05}\",\n            \"requested_name\": f\"سيتال 500 مجم اقراص {i+1}\",\n            \"candidates\": [\n                {\"id\": f\"WH{i+1:05}_1\", \"name\": f\"سيتال اقراص 500 مجم باكو {i+1}\"},\n                {\"id\": f\"WH{i+1:05}_2\", \"name\": f\"بارامول 500 مجم اقراص {i+1}\"}\n            ]\n        })\n    body = {\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o\",\n        \"messages\": [\n            {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": f\"Return JSON with results for {count} items: \" + json.dumps({\"cases\": cases}, ensure_ascii=False)}\n        ]\n    }\n    payload_kb = len(json.dumps(body, ensure_ascii=False).encode('utf-8')) / 1024\n    print(f\"\\nTesting count={count} (Payload: {payload_kb:.1f} KB)...\")\n    t0 = time.time()\n    try:\n        r = requests.post(url, headers={\"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {api_key}\"}, json=body, timeout=60)\n        elapsed = time.time() - t0\n        content = r.json()[\"choices\"][0][\"message\"][\"content\"]\n        if \"[ChatGPT returned\" in content:\n            print(f\"FAILED in {elapsed:.1f}s: {content.strip()}\")\n            return False\n        else:\n            print(f\"SUCCESS in {elapsed:.1f}s! Response length: {len(content)} chars\")\n            print(\"Preview:\", content[:150])\n            return True\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"Exception: {e}\")\n        return False\n\n# Test progressively: 50, 100, 200, 300\nfor c in [50, 100, 150, 200, 300]:\n    ok = test_items(c)\n    if not ok:\n        print(f\"--> Limit is below {c} items!\")\n        break\n    time.sleep(5)\n","Description":"Script to find payload size limit of MSEMAX","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\kakak\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a\\scratch\\test_payload_limit.py","toolAction":"Create test_payload_limit.py","toolSummary":"Test batch size limit on MSEMAX"}}]}
